---
const tracks = [
  ['01','HPC Industry Innovation Showcase','KEC students & faculty','Free'],
  ['02','HPC Industry Innovation Challenge','Registered teams / external participants','Free / nominal cost'],
  ['03','Hands-on Workshops','General registered participants','₹300 one · ₹500 both']
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" /><title>HPC Innovation Conclave 2027</title><meta name="description" content="HPC Innovation Conclave 2027 · 5–6 February 2027 at Kongu Engineering College." /></head>
<body>
<header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/aiconclave/">HPC INNOVATION CONCLAVE 2027</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/aiconclave/announcement/">Announcement</a><a href="/aiconclave/about/">About</a><a href="/aiconclave/tracks/">Tracks</a><a href="/aiconclave/event-plan/">Event Plan</a><a href="/aiconclave/showcase/">Showcase</a><a href="/aiconclave/challenge/">Challenge</a><a href="/aiconclave/workshops/">Workshops</a></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-inner"><div class="topline"><span>HPC INNOVATION CONCLAVE 2027</span><span>05–06 FEB 2027 · KEC</span></div><div class="identity-strip"><div class="identity-mark"><strong>KEC</strong><span>Kongu Engineering College</span></div><div class="identity-mark"><strong>CSE</strong><span>Association</span></div></div><div class="hero-copy"><p class="kicker">CONNECT · COMPUTE · CREATE · SHOWCASE</p><h1>Build with<br /><em>HPC.</em></h1><p class="intro">A two-day HPC-focused conclave bringing together industry leadership, hands-on computing workshops, a 24-hour industry innovation challenge and a showcase of solutions created by KEC students and faculty.</p></div><div class="signals"><div><strong>02</strong><span>Days</span></div><div><strong>24H</strong><span>Innovation challenge</span></div><div><strong>02</strong><span>Hands-on workshops</span></div><div><strong>03</strong><span>Distinct tracks</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="about"><div class="label">ABOUT THE CONCLAVE</div><div class="about-grid"><h2>Connect.<br /><em>Compute. Create.</em></h2><div><p>HPC Innovation Conclave 2027 takes place on <strong>Friday, 5 February and Saturday, 6 February 2027</strong> at Kongu Engineering College.</p><p>The programme moves from keynote and industry leadership discussions into hands-on learning, competitive problem solving and innovation showcase activities.</p><a class="text-link" href="/aiconclave/about/">Read about the conclave →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="tracks"><div class="section-head"><div class="label">THREE TRACKS</div><a href="/aiconclave/tracks/">View all tracks →</a></div><div class="track-list">{tracks.map(([num,title,who,fee])=><a class="track-row" href={num==='01'?'/aiconclave/showcase/':num==='02'?'/aiconclave/challenge/':'/aiconclave/workshops/'}><span class="number">{num}</span><div><small>{who}</small><h2>{title}</h2></div><strong>{fee}</strong></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="plan"><div class="label">EVENT PLAN</div><h2>05 FEB<br /><em>Connect &amp; Explore.</em></h2><p>Inauguration · HPC Keynote · Industry Leadership Panel · GPU Computing &amp; CUDA · Challenge Launch</p><h2>06 FEB<br /><em>Build &amp; Showcase.</em></h2><p>GenAI &amp; LLMs on HPC · Innovation Showcase · Careers &amp; Certifications · Challenge Evaluation · Closing</p><a class="text-link" href="/aiconclave/event-plan/">See the complete event plan →</a></section>
<section class="closing"><p>HPC INNOVATION CONCLAVE 2027 · 05–06 FEBRUARY</p><h2>Connect.<br /><em>Compute. Create. Showcase.</em></h2><p>Explore the programme and choose your participation track.</p></section>
</main>
<div class="registration-bar"><div><span>HPC INNOVATION CONCLAVE 2027</span><strong>Choose your track</strong></div><button class="register-button" id="register-open" type="button">Register <span>↗</span></button></div>
<div class="rules-modal" id="rules-modal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="rules-backdrop" data-rules-close></div><section class="rules-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="rules-title"><button class="rules-close" type="button" aria-label="Close" data-rules-close>×</button><p class="kicker">BEFORE YOU REGISTER</p><h2 id="rules-title">Rules &amp;<br /><em>constraints.</em></h2><p class="rules-intro">Please read the participation rules before continuing to the registration and payment page.</p><div class="rule-list"><div><b>01</b><span>Participation is restricted to <strong>one track only</strong> — Showcase, Challenge, or Workshops.</span></div><div><b>02</b><span>Cross-participation across tracks is not permitted.</span></div><div><b>03</b><span>Challenge participants cannot participate in the Hands-on Workshops on either day.</span></div><div><b>04</b><span>All participants must complete registration in advance and carry valid registration confirmation / ID.</span></div><div><b>05</b><span>Showcase is for KEC students and faculty and requires a completed / working solution.</span></div><div><b>06</b><span>The Challenge runs continuously for 24 hours from 2:15 PM on 5 February to 2:15 PM on 6 February.</span></div><div><b>07</b><span>Workshops cost ₹300 for one workshop or ₹500 for both; participants should bring their own laptop.</span></div><div><b>08</b><span>Lunch is provided only for participants of the 24-hour Innovation Challenge.</span></div></div><div class="countdown-wrap"><span id="countdown">30</span><small>seconds remaining before continuing</small></div><button id="rules-continue" class="rules-continue" type="button" disabled>Continue to registration <span>→</span></button><p id="wait-note" class="wait-note">The registration button will unlock after the 30-second review period.</p></section></div>
</body></html>
<style>
